p.me:
\frac{\Delta(fg)}{h}
=
g\frac{\Delta f}{h}
+
f\frac{\Delta g}{h}
+
\Delta f\frac{\Delta g}{h}.

\frac{f(x+h)g(x+h)-f(x)g(x)}{h}
=
g(x)\frac{\Delta f}{h}
+
f(x)\frac{\Delta g}{h}
+
\Delta f\frac{\Delta g}{h}.

